      "name": "Pounce",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The alce Strides and makes a talon Strike at the end of that movement. If the alce began this action Hidden, it remains hidden until after the attack.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Regal Shriek",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "emotion",
        "fear",
        "mental"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The alce unleashes a shriek that transitions into a terrifying roar. Each creature in a 60ft Emanation must attempt a DC 20 Will Saving Throw save. Regardless of the result, creatures are temporarily immune to all griffons' Regal Shrieks for 10 minutes.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is Frightened 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is Frightened 2. Animals are Slowed 1 for as long as they're frightened.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is Frightened 3. Animals are Paralyzed as long as they're frightened.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
